  <title id="title">One Skipped Draw Desynchronizes Two Backends Forever</title>
  <desc id="desc">CPU and GPU xoshiro256++ streams diverge permanently when one backend clamps a deterministic measurement without consuming a random draw while the other backend consumes one, even though both produce the same measurement outcome.</desc>

